  title: 'Input: Interactions'
  description: 'Welcome back, courageous adventurer, to the second chamber of our
    enchanted labyrinth. Here, amidst the shifting shadows and whispered secrets,
    you shall unlock a new power that transcends the confines of mere mortal movement.


    But
    heed this, adventurer: though the paths diverge, the destination remains the
    same. It matters not which path you choose, for the power of teleportation shall
    guide you unerringly to your chosen destination.'
